WEBVTT

00:01:17.640 --> 00:01:19.809
I'm always searching for it

00:01:30.486 --> 00:01:31.821
Always seeking it out

00:01:41.664 --> 00:01:44.167
A miss. Kelp filling again.

00:01:44.709 --> 00:01:46.169
Today's is all kelp.

00:01:46.711 --> 00:01:48.004
Why, Akane?

00:01:48.087 --> 00:01:50.757
I said a million times
that I want mayonnaise and tuna!

00:01:50.840 --> 00:01:52.842
- I like kelp.
- You heard her.

00:01:52.925 --> 00:01:54.344
You lost to Aoi.

00:01:54.844 --> 00:01:56.638
A million times said, and you still lost.

00:01:58.806 --> 00:01:59.974
Shut up.

00:02:00.224 --> 00:02:01.768
Come on, let's practice.

00:02:02.810 --> 00:02:04.771
But I'm still eating!

00:02:04.854 --> 00:02:06.105
Hurry up and finish!

00:02:06.189 --> 00:02:08.733
My "Akane Special” is going to roar.

00:02:08.816 --> 00:02:10.318
That's a terrible name.

00:02:11.569 --> 00:02:12.695
Me too.

00:02:13.738 --> 00:02:14.947
I want to play, too.

00:02:16.074 --> 00:02:18.201
You want me to teach you the guitar?

00:02:21.579 --> 00:02:23.289
Then what do you want to play?

00:02:27.877 --> 00:02:29.671
What, seriously?

00:02:29.754 --> 00:02:32.965
Do you admire me or something, Aoi?

00:02:33.049 --> 00:02:34.008
No!

00:02:34.300 --> 00:02:35.718
Really?

00:02:36.219 --> 00:02:39.347
Come to think of it,
it'd be cool if a woman played the bass.

00:02:39.931 --> 00:02:43.518
All right, Ao! When you get bigger,
you'll play bass in our band.

00:02:43.601 --> 00:02:45.395
Hey! Then what'll I do?

00:02:45.478 --> 00:02:47.105
Good for you, Aoi.

00:02:47.188 --> 00:02:48.856
Abo, you can be the chorus?

00:02:49.982 --> 00:02:52.068
Or how about a dancer?

00:02:52.151 --> 00:02:53.653
<i>Listen, Banha.</i>

00:02:53.736 --> 00:02:55.738
Come on, we're going to practice, right?

00:02:55.988 --> 00:02:57.240
What should we start with?

00:03:00.743 --> 00:03:01.369
Akane?

00:03:01.953 --> 00:03:02.745
The usual!

00:03:03.204 --> 00:03:04.080
All right!

00:03:04.163 --> 00:03:05.248
Again?

00:03:05.331 --> 00:03:06.916
Here we go, Michinko!

00:03:07.166 --> 00:03:07.917
Yeah, yeah.

00:03:08.334 --> 00:03:09.585
Wait a second.

00:03:09.919 --> 00:03:10.920
Oh, come on!

00:03:11.504 --> 00:03:14.006
<i>- Banha, plug in the mic!
- Huh?</i>

00:03:14.090 --> 00:03:15.550
All right, here we go!

00:03:16.634 --> 00:03:18.052
If you go there...

00:03:25.435 --> 00:03:27.979
If you go there...

00:03:28.062 --> 00:03:35.528
<i>It's said that all your dreams will come true</i>

00:03:36.404 --> 00:03:41.701
Everyone wants to go there

00:03:41.784 --> 00:03:46.122
But it's a far away world

00:03:46.581 --> 00:03:49.542
That country's name ls Gandfiara

00:03:49.625 --> 00:03:52.003
<i>It's a utopia that's out there somewhere</i>

00:03:52.086 --> 00:03:53.129
How could I even get there?

00:03:53.129 --> 00:03:54.046
How could I even get there?
But..

00:03:54.046 --> 00:03:55.047
How could I even get there?

00:03:55.131 --> 00:03:55.465
Someone please tell me

00:03:55.465 --> 00:03:57.300
Someone please tell me
that place...

00:03:57.300 --> 00:03:57.800
Someone please tell me

00:04:00.052 --> 00:04:02.597
ls just so far away...

00:04:02.680 --> 00:04:04.182
They were in an accident...

00:04:04.265 --> 00:04:06.100
For both of them to go...

00:04:06.184 --> 00:04:08.770
I heard the other person
wasn't watching the road.

00:04:08.895 --> 00:04:11.773
It's such a shame,
leaving two daughters behind.

00:04:12.315 --> 00:04:14.817
Akane is a third-year student, isn't she?

00:04:15.318 --> 00:04:16.736
What will she do?

00:04:17.653 --> 00:04:20.907
Aoi, be a good girl and obey your sister.

00:04:21.657 --> 00:04:24.660
From now on,
the two of you will have to work hard.

00:04:38.716 --> 00:04:40.301
I can't go there.

00:04:43.513 --> 00:04:45.515
Why? What do you mean?

00:04:45.807 --> 00:04:47.850
We made a promise to both go
to a vocational school in Tokyo!

00:04:52.230 --> 00:04:53.147
Akane!

00:04:55.525 --> 00:04:57.944
Don't bully Akane, you dummy!

00:04:58.027 --> 00:04:59.278
Aoi.

00:04:59.362 --> 00:05:01.697
Don't take Akane away from me, you dummy!

00:05:02.073 --> 00:05:02.698
Fatso!

00:05:02.824 --> 00:05:05.368
Fat? My body fat is 7%!

00:05:05.493 --> 00:05:06.786
- Shut up, you pig!
- Hey, Aoi.

00:05:06.869 --> 00:05:09.831
Monkey! Gorilla! Don't take Akane away!

00:05:09.914 --> 00:05:12.708
Akane and I will always be together!

00:05:22.093 --> 00:05:25.888
I'm still looking for it

00:05:35.231 --> 00:05:36.816
FROM: AKANE
LET'S GO HOME.

00:06:04.510 --> 00:06:05.428
OCTOBER 28TH

00:06:24.488 --> 00:06:25.573
I'm searching for it

00:06:33.331 --> 00:06:35.082
<i>The place where all dreams come true.</i>

00:06:35.082 --> 00:06:36.918
<i>Her Blue Sky
The place where all dreams come true.</i>

00:06:36.918 --> 00:06:43.549
Her Blue Sky

00:06:49.805 --> 00:06:51.223
I'm going to Tokyo.

00:06:51.307 --> 00:06:55.645
I understand the place you want to go,
but it's not for college, right?

00:06:55.811 --> 00:06:56.938
Employment?

00:06:57.438 --> 00:07:00.066
I'll work part-time
while rising to fame in a band.

00:07:00.149 --> 00:07:02.568
A band... Who are the members?

00:07:02.652 --> 00:07:04.153
Just me.

00:07:04.946 --> 00:07:09.408
I'll check off "employment.”
Okay, next. Ohtaki, come in.

00:07:09.492 --> 00:07:10.785
Okay.

00:07:12.954 --> 00:07:14.413
Is she in a mood?

00:07:14.664 --> 00:07:18.501
- Hurry it up, Oht--
- Oh, I'm going to become a bride!

00:07:18.626 --> 00:07:22.004
- I don't know who the person is, but--
- Okay, "Employment.”

00:07:22.505 --> 00:07:23.506
Okay, next.

00:07:23.631 --> 00:07:27.843
Hey, let's talk a little bit more about my future!

00:07:32.640 --> 00:07:36.852
City Hall gets busy near the end of the year.

00:07:37.186 --> 00:07:39.313
I probably can't pick you up next month.

00:07:40.523 --> 00:07:44.860
It takes about an hour
to walk to school from our house!

00:07:45.152 --> 00:07:46.821
Well, it's a nice season.

00:07:46.904 --> 00:07:49.865
You get to admire the autumn leaves
while hiking up the mountain.

00:07:51.742 --> 00:07:53.536
I hate mountains.

00:07:54.996 --> 00:07:59.709
When you're living in a basin,
it's like being surrounded by walls.

00:08:00.543 --> 00:08:04.338
We're being held captive in a gigantic prison.

00:08:04.422 --> 00:08:06.716
There it is! Your puberty lyrics.

00:08:06.841 --> 00:08:08.509
Okay, whatever.

00:08:08.592 --> 00:08:11.679
Anyway, I'm going to leave this place.

00:08:25.484 --> 00:08:26.527
Huh?

00:08:30.865 --> 00:08:31.866
Hello!

00:08:31.949 --> 00:08:33.159
Oh!

00:08:33.242 --> 00:08:35.828
Welcome home, Akane and Aoi.

00:08:35.911 --> 00:08:37.246
What are you doing?

00:08:37.371 --> 00:08:38.914
Tonight's meeting.

00:08:39.040 --> 00:08:41.459
Masamichi invited too many people

00:08:41.542 --> 00:08:43.127
so I was just borrowing some cushions
and tables from Mrs. Yamaguchi.

00:08:43.127 --> 00:08:44.336
- This should be plenty now.
- Yes, I think so. so I was just borrowing some cushions and tables from Mrs. Yamaguchi.

00:08:44.336 --> 00:08:44.420
- This should be plenty now.
- Yes, I think so.

00:08:44.420 --> 00:08:46.714
- This should be plenty now. - Yes, I think so.
- T'll help you. Come on, Aoi! - Oh, that's okay.

00:08:46.714 --> 00:08:48.049
-T'll help you. Come on, Aoi!
- Oh, that's okay.

00:08:51.594 --> 00:08:53.679
Sorry. And you were on your way home, too.

00:08:53.763 --> 00:08:56.766
Not at all. I'll be at the meeting, too, so...

00:08:57.141 --> 00:08:59.310
Oh, Akane, would you like to eat a pear?

00:08:59.393 --> 00:09:00.936
Sure, I'd love one!

00:09:01.020 --> 00:09:03.105
You have a wonderful big sister.

00:09:03.397 --> 00:09:05.274
Be grateful, Aoi.

00:09:05.983 --> 00:09:12.281
<i>When peaple tell me to "be grateful” all the time,
it makes me want to rebel instead.</i>

00:09:12.823 --> 00:09:14.241
FIRST CITY OF MUSIC FESTIVAL
INFORMATION MEETING

00:09:14.241 --> 00:09:15.701
FIRST CITY OF MUSIC FESTIVAL INFORMATION MEETING Yeah, the
miso potato cart should have different kinds of flavors.

00:09:15.701 --> 00:09:20.164
Yeah, the miso potato cart
should have different kinds of flavors.

00:09:20.247 --> 00:09:23.417
Like miso mixed with yuzu,
or mixed with seven spices.

00:09:23.501 --> 00:09:26.670
But will people actually come
to something like this?

00:09:26.754 --> 00:09:29.507
Why are you being so pessimistic?

00:09:29.590 --> 00:09:34.011
In this area, the city has been stealing
all of the tourists, even with sightseeing.

00:09:34.095 --> 00:09:37.807
From here on out,
we need to plant our own flag.

00:09:37.890 --> 00:09:40.726
Yeah! We have to catch a big wave,
or it'll be our loss.

00:09:40.810 --> 00:09:44.730
After all, the Tourism Bureau's very own
Masamichi put up funds for us.

00:09:44.814 --> 00:09:45.815
Exactly!

00:09:45.898 --> 00:09:50.361
Even at City Hall, it's rumored that
he's moving around quite a lot of this.

00:09:50.444 --> 00:09:51.779
Don't spread false rumors, Akane!

00:09:52.113 --> 00:09:53.614
What, so it's not true?

00:09:53.697 --> 00:09:55.032
I bet there's plenty of funds.

00:09:55.116 --> 00:09:56.534
Look, you have to understand.

00:09:56.617 --> 00:10:01.997
In addition to bringing in a singer and band
from outside, we the locals should...

00:10:02.373 --> 00:10:04.333
Why don't you participate, Ao?

00:10:06.335 --> 00:10:10.798
If it's used for a town renewal project,
then it's not music anymore.

00:10:11.132 --> 00:10:12.967
That's not enjoying the sound.

00:10:13.050 --> 00:10:16.345
Instead of music to your ears,
it's music that bores to tears.

00:10:17.221 --> 00:10:21.809
You may think you said something clever,
but you didn't.

00:10:22.685 --> 00:10:23.727
Ow! Ow! Ow!

00:10:23.811 --> 00:10:28.023
Anyway, this town will be reborn
through music!

00:10:33.863 --> 00:10:35.656
Aoi! Tsugu!

00:10:36.740 --> 00:10:37.700
Dad.

00:10:39.076 --> 00:10:43.330
Uh, so are you going to practice again
at the hall today?

00:10:43.414 --> 00:10:44.165
Yeah.

00:10:44.248 --> 00:10:45.708
Just wrap it up by 9:00 p.m.

00:10:45.833 --> 00:10:49.879
The low tone of your bass
reverbs a bit, and it sounds creepy.

00:10:53.007 --> 00:10:55.384
I have a soundproof room at my house.

00:10:57.344 --> 00:10:59.388
You don't want a big brother?

00:11:01.015 --> 00:11:03.350
Come on, Dad, slow your roll.

00:11:03.434 --> 00:11:05.728
I won't let her marry anyone
who's been divorced.

00:11:05.853 --> 00:11:10.274
I'm a victim! My wife cheated on me!
I'm a divorcee with a halo!

00:11:10.357 --> 00:11:11.567
Doesn't matter.

00:11:12.359 --> 00:11:14.028
Hey, Aoi!

00:11:15.362 --> 00:11:17.740
Do you remember Shinno?

00:11:19.700 --> 00:11:21.619
Oh. Vaguely.

00:11:21.702 --> 00:11:22.411
Why?

00:11:22.536 --> 00:11:25.706
Oh, if you don't remember, that's okay.

00:11:31.503 --> 00:11:36.926
My hit points that keep going down

00:11:37.551 --> 00:11:43.265
It's probably my fault anyway

00:11:44.892 --> 00:11:45.392
Anyway, this is a difficult place to live in

00:11:45.392 --> 00:11:47.228
Anyway, this is a difficult place to live in
What my dad said before...

00:11:47.228 --> 00:11:50.064
Anyway, this is a difficult place to live in

00:11:50.147 --> 00:11:51.065
I don't agree with it either.

00:11:51.065 --> 00:11:52.399
17 stinks like blue cheese...
I don't agree with it either.

00:11:52.399 --> 00:11:52.942
11 stinks like blue cheese...

00:11:52.942 --> 00:11:55.486
11 stinks like blue cheese...
But still, he too, is...

00:11:55.569 --> 00:11:58.239
Don't talk about that here.

00:11:58.739 --> 00:12:00.741
So we can talk about it if it's not here?

00:12:02.743 --> 00:12:04.245
I'd rather not but...

00:12:05.079 --> 00:12:07.456
it would be better than here.

00:12:08.582 --> 00:12:09.625
Wrong.

00:12:09.917 --> 00:12:12.378
Here. You have to hold it down tight.

00:12:14.171 --> 00:12:19.468
Oh, hey Ao, I just noticed
you have a mole in the white of your eye.

00:12:20.094 --> 00:12:22.304
Same with me!

00:12:22.930 --> 00:12:25.557
A mole in the eyeball
is a sign we're going to become big shots.

00:12:25.641 --> 00:12:28.269
We're both eyeball stars.

00:12:28.978 --> 00:12:30.312
Eyeball stars!

00:12:31.146 --> 00:12:34.400
What's with that name? No one would get it.

00:12:34.483 --> 00:12:36.652
What? It's cool!

00:12:36.819 --> 00:12:37.987
It's cool!

00:12:49.623 --> 00:12:53.585
Dankichi Nitobe is the one who performed
in the New Year's TV song contest, right?

00:12:53.669 --> 00:12:55.838
Yeah, I kind of remember.

00:12:56.297 --> 00:12:58.757
He rode in a weird, flashy portable shrine.

00:12:58.841 --> 00:13:01.593
Oh, I saw that one, too.

00:13:01.677 --> 00:13:05.639
To go with this event, we're going to have him
write a song about the area.

00:13:06.015 --> 00:13:09.143
He'll use the phrase
"fireworks go boom-boom" in the lyrics

00:13:09.226 --> 00:13:12.271
and when he sings it,
real fireworks will go boom-boom-boom!

00:13:12.354 --> 00:13:13.439
Fireworks? Wow.

00:13:13.522 --> 00:13:15.774
So that means you really did move a lot of this.

00:13:15.858 --> 00:13:24.199
This will be... my opus.
Th-The opus I'm staking my life on.

00:13:26.201 --> 00:13:29.705
So I'm counting on your help
with this event, Akane.

00:13:30.706 --> 00:13:33.542
I already cleared it with the Civic Life Bureau.

00:13:33.709 --> 00:13:36.420
So I've heard. Good luck, Ms. Aioi.

00:13:36.503 --> 00:13:37.212
Wait!

00:13:37.379 --> 00:13:39.381
Nakamura, the meeting's going to start!

00:13:40.215 --> 00:13:42.676
I'll give you the details later!

00:13:42.760 --> 00:13:44.386
Wait a second, Michinko!

00:13:44.720 --> 00:13:49.391
Well, we're not very busy right now anyway,
so give it your best!

00:13:54.938 --> 00:13:58.734
You do know that Michinko likes you, right?

00:14:00.110 --> 00:14:01.403
Well...

00:14:01.904 --> 00:14:04.573
You shouldn't do anything to lead him on.

00:14:10.204 --> 00:14:13.582
He's an old friend
and we work at the same place.

00:14:13.999 --> 00:14:16.460
Even if I know he has feelings for me,

00:14:16.543 --> 00:14:18.754
there are things that mustn't be said.

00:14:18.921 --> 00:14:19.254
<i>AIOL
AKANE AND AOL</i>

00:14:19.254 --> 00:14:21.423
<i>AIOL AKANE AND AOL
That's adult manners.</i>

00:14:21.423 --> 00:14:22.508
<i>AIOL
AKANE AND AOL</i>

00:14:22.674 --> 00:14:25.260
Being an adult is so boring.

00:14:27.221 --> 00:14:28.472
That aside...

00:14:29.807 --> 00:14:32.351
Why don't you think about it once more?

00:14:33.143 --> 00:14:34.520
College.

00:14:35.312 --> 00:14:38.232
You can study and still be in a band.

00:14:38.315 --> 00:14:40.692
We've already been through this.

00:14:41.110 --> 00:14:44.029
You promised to stop bugging me about it.

00:14:45.781 --> 00:14:48.700
Don't break your promise.

00:14:52.329 --> 00:14:54.039
Okay, I'm going to go practice.

00:16:00.189 --> 00:16:01.440
Stop that!

00:16:01.732 --> 00:16:03.609
Where the hell did that come from?

00:16:03.734 --> 00:16:06.278
And your rhythm and timing are gross!

00:16:12.534 --> 00:16:13.285
Who are you?

00:16:17.789 --> 00:16:18.540
Hey.

00:16:19.249 --> 00:16:21.793
We re both Eyeball stars.

00:16:22.920 --> 00:16:24.963
Shin... no?

00:16:25.923 --> 00:16:29.635
You know me?
Hey, that's my school's uniform.

00:16:30.093 --> 00:16:32.804
Maybe you're one of my fans?

00:16:32.888 --> 00:16:34.139
You wanna shake hands?

00:16:35.307 --> 00:16:36.141
Uh...

00:16:36.850 --> 00:16:38.310
Huh? Wh...

00:16:43.815 --> 00:16:46.151
So you are Shinno...

00:16:46.276 --> 00:16:48.654
Of course I am! And who are you?

00:16:49.112 --> 00:16:50.155
Akane!

00:16:50.280 --> 00:16:52.658
Hey, wait! Hey!

00:16:53.784 --> 00:16:54.993
I said, hold on!

00:16:59.623 --> 00:17:00.832
Hey, what is this?

00:17:04.461 --> 00:17:06.505
Wh-What the hell is this?

00:17:06.964 --> 00:17:10.008
Hey, let me out of here!

00:17:17.808 --> 00:17:19.518
A-Akane!

00:17:19.810 --> 00:17:21.728
Huh? Are you done practicing already?

00:17:21.812 --> 00:17:23.855
I'm making your favorite for tonight,
minced meat--

00:17:23.981 --> 00:17:25.190
Sh-Shinno is...

00:17:27.985 --> 00:17:28.860
Sorry!

00:17:29.444 --> 00:17:32.030
So what about Shinno?

00:17:33.991 --> 00:17:38.704
Um... Right!
I was practicing and suddenly thought of him.

00:17:39.162 --> 00:17:43.542
I was wondering how he's doing.
That's all, really.

00:17:45.168 --> 00:17:47.879
I haven't heard from him in ages.

00:17:48.505 --> 00:17:51.717
I don't even know if he's alive or dead.

00:17:54.803 --> 00:17:57.556
<i>I see. So there was that possibility, too.</i>

00:17:57.848 --> 00:17:59.558
In fact, that's the only possibility!

00:17:59.850 --> 00:18:03.228
After all, he hasn't changed one bit

00:18:03.687 --> 00:18:04.563
Aoi?

00:18:05.522 --> 00:18:08.108
Hey, you left your front door open.

00:18:08.191 --> 00:18:09.943
That's careless.

00:18:10.027 --> 00:18:10.902
Michinko?

00:18:11.028 --> 00:18:13.447
Wait, what are you two doing?

00:18:13.530 --> 00:18:15.073
- What're we doing?
- Making din--

00:18:15.198 --> 00:18:16.700
This is no time for that!

00:18:17.951 --> 00:18:19.578
I need help with the event!

00:18:19.661 --> 00:18:20.871
Yes, I heard, but...

00:18:20.954 --> 00:18:23.707
Huh? I didn't tell you about today?

00:18:23.790 --> 00:18:24.666
Today?

00:18:24.750 --> 00:18:27.085
Never mind! We need to get moving!

00:18:29.880 --> 00:18:34.092
When he gets here, hold this up high,
with all the gusto you can muster!

00:18:34.259 --> 00:18:38.055
So this is what
you were working on last night?

00:18:38.138 --> 00:18:40.432
Hey, don't spill any miso on it!

00:18:40.515 --> 00:18:43.894
- Sheesh. I shouldn't even be here.
- But why is he coming today?

00:18:43.977 --> 00:18:45.646
The event is a week from now, right?

00:18:45.729 --> 00:18:46.730
The thing is...

00:18:47.064 --> 00:18:50.108
Mr. Nitobe is the authority
on local songs, right?

00:18:50.192 --> 00:18:54.279
He said something like not being able
to sing about the soul of the land

00:18:54.571 --> 00:18:57.616
unless he first samples the local food
and mingles with the people.

00:18:57.699 --> 00:19:00.160
And City Hall is paying for that, huh?

00:19:00.577 --> 00:19:05.248
That's definitely what you call
sponging off someone, right?

00:19:05.999 --> 00:19:06.958
Tsugu?

00:19:11.546 --> 00:19:12.464
What the...

00:19:17.219 --> 00:19:20.138
Ladies and gentlemen, thank you for waiting.

00:19:20.389 --> 00:19:23.684
One lone man, Dankichi Nitobe,

00:19:23.767 --> 00:19:30.399
has crossed fields from afar and traversed
mountains to bring you the gift of a smile.

00:19:30.482 --> 00:19:32.818
- A f-feint?
- Is that Dan?

00:19:32.943 --> 00:19:34.945
- The real one?
- What's he doing here?

00:19:36.780 --> 00:19:38.156
Akane?

00:19:40.575 --> 00:19:45.163
Here I am, this handsome man

00:19:45.247 --> 00:19:48.583
Get your smart phones out and say cheese!

00:19:50.210 --> 00:19:52.587
<i>If I was able to meet you...
1-is that...</i>

00:19:52.587 --> 00:19:53.213
<i>If I was able to meet you...</i>

00:19:53.213 --> 00:19:54.423
<i>If I was able to meet you...
Shinno.</i>

00:19:54.756 --> 00:19:55.090
Come on, Tsugu! Hold it up high!

00:19:55.090 --> 00:19:57.426
Then my happiness points have doubled,
boom! Come on, Tsugu! Hold it up high!

00:19:57.426 --> 00:19:58.927
Then my happiness points
have doubled, boom!

00:19:59.052 --> 00:20:00.429
A little tiresome, a little painful
(But still!)

00:20:00.429 --> 00:20:02.556
<i>A little tiresome, a little painful (But still!)
WELCOME, MASTER! WELCOME HOME, SHINNOSUKE!</i>

00:20:02.556 --> 00:20:03.682
A little tiresome, a little painful
(But still!)

00:20:03.765 --> 00:20:08.520
<i>But after all that's said and done,
you still get hungry</i>

00:20:08.603 --> 00:20:13.275
<i>Another helping of your smile,
there's nothing better</i>

00:20:13.567 --> 00:20:17.112
Okay everyone, together now, say cheese!

00:20:22.409 --> 00:20:23.618
Hey, Ao!

00:20:23.910 --> 00:20:25.287
Jeez.

00:20:32.461 --> 00:20:37.799
Mom, Dad, and all of my ancestors,
please give me strength!

00:20:38.467 --> 00:20:39.634
Man.

00:20:41.136 --> 00:20:44.139
Ao, the taxi driver gave me an invoice.
What do ...

00:20:45.307 --> 00:20:46.308
Hey.

00:20:48.977 --> 00:20:52.481
So that "Shinno" person was really in there?

00:20:52.647 --> 00:20:53.440
Yeah.

00:20:53.523 --> 00:20:55.734
I thought he was a ghost,

00:20:55.817 --> 00:21:00.739
but I saw the real Shinno at the station,
so what did I see here?

00:21:00.822 --> 00:21:02.324
A lookalike?

00:21:02.491 --> 00:21:06.411
I don't understand it,
but he was definitely Shinno, too.

00:21:06.495 --> 00:21:08.997
I don't get it,
but something really weird is going on!

00:21:12.292 --> 00:21:13.168
Well?

00:21:15.003 --> 00:21:16.505
Nobody's here.

00:21:18.131 --> 00:21:19.841
That can't be...

00:21:21.802 --> 00:21:23.845
Why did you run away from me?

00:21:26.181 --> 00:21:29.017
- Ao? L-Let go of her!
- Whoa.

00:21:30.352 --> 00:21:33.188
Huh? Who's this kid?
He looks just like Michinko.

00:21:36.525 --> 00:21:38.109
What are you?

00:21:38.193 --> 00:21:39.861
I said, I'm Shinno!

00:21:39.986 --> 00:21:41.738
Who the hell are you?

00:21:41.822 --> 00:21:44.032
Ao, for now, run away.

00:21:44.366 --> 00:21:46.034
Ao?

00:21:47.702 --> 00:21:49.162
Aoi Aioi.

00:21:49.871 --> 00:21:52.374
Eyeball star number two.

00:21:59.881 --> 00:22:03.385
That day, Akane told me
she wasn't going to Tokyo.

00:22:06.930 --> 00:22:09.140
I felt like I couldn't go home.

00:22:12.435 --> 00:22:15.313
For some reason, I was here
and thought about a lot of things.

00:22:15.438 --> 00:22:17.983
And the next thing I knew...

00:22:19.276 --> 00:22:20.819
it was morning?

00:22:21.403 --> 00:22:22.362
Why is that a question?

00:22:22.445 --> 00:22:24.489
I don't get it either.

00:22:25.448 --> 00:22:30.537
But I felt sluggish, so I was zoning out there
when this awful cacophony woke me up.

00:22:30.620 --> 00:22:31.997
Cacophony?

00:22:33.790 --> 00:22:41.172
I swear, it feels like I just got up, so when
you tell me it's 13 years later, it's confusing.

00:22:41.464 --> 00:22:44.050
I see. You're like Rip Van Winkle.

00:22:44.134 --> 00:22:46.052
Is that even...

00:22:46.136 --> 00:22:50.515
Oh well. If time has passed,
there's nothing I can do about it.

00:22:50.807 --> 00:22:52.684
You're quick to accept a weird situation.

00:22:52.976 --> 00:22:57.147
Nah, I'm accepting it thanks to you.

00:22:57.981 --> 00:23:00.400
You're obviously a miniature Michinko.

00:23:00.483 --> 00:23:01.693
He's happy-go-lucky.

00:23:01.818 --> 00:23:05.864
At least we know he's not a ghost.
He has a physical form.

00:23:06.114 --> 00:23:09.034
I-I see. But then...

00:23:11.453 --> 00:23:12.871
Maybe a living spirit...

00:23:12.954 --> 00:23:14.205
Living spirit?

00:23:14.331 --> 00:23:16.041
You've heard of it, right?

00:23:16.499 --> 00:23:18.752
When you have strong feelings
towards someone,

00:23:18.835 --> 00:23:21.713
a spirit spawned from those feelings
leaves your body without you realizing it.

00:23:22.005 --> 00:23:25.717
I've heard about that!
The spirit puts a deadly curse on that person!

00:23:26.635 --> 00:23:29.721
It's because Akane turned Shinno down, so...

00:23:29.804 --> 00:23:32.724
Maybe you were born
from those unresolved feelings.

00:23:32.974 --> 00:23:34.392
What are you talking about?

00:23:35.185 --> 00:23:39.564
Unresolved feelings or whatever,
I haven't given up.

00:23:40.690 --> 00:23:42.901
After thinking about it, I made up my mind.

00:23:43.026 --> 00:23:46.279
First I'll go to Tokyo
and become a big musician!

00:23:46.363 --> 00:23:49.783
Then I'll come back for Akane
with all this fanfare!

00:23:49.866 --> 00:23:50.951
He's so excessively positive.

00:23:51.034 --> 00:23:54.746
So why did this have to happen?

00:23:55.080 --> 00:23:57.457
Akane must be 31 by now, right?

00:23:57.540 --> 00:24:00.085
Wait, so 31... Then... 30...

00:24:00.543 --> 00:24:02.504
Hey, Akane isn't married, is she?

00:24:02.587 --> 00:24:03.797
- No.
- All right!

00:24:03.880 --> 00:24:06.508
Wait, I shouldn't be happy about that.

00:24:07.133 --> 00:24:08.885
I have to hurry and get...

00:24:08.969 --> 00:24:10.512
Do you want to see her?

00:24:10.804 --> 00:24:13.682
- Are you an idiot? I can't see her like this!
- Idiot? What a jerk.

00:24:13.807 --> 00:24:16.059
Weren't you listening to me?

00:24:16.142 --> 00:24:17.978
I have to become a big musician first.

00:24:18.061 --> 00:24:21.690
I don't know if he's big or not,
but he did become a musician, right?

00:24:22.482 --> 00:24:28.196
Oh, true, your 31-year-old self
did become a musician, in a way.

00:24:31.324 --> 00:24:33.702
That's awesome!

00:24:33.827 --> 00:24:35.704
I'll be right back!

00:24:36.413 --> 00:24:37.539
- Hey!
- See you!

00:24:45.755 --> 00:24:48.550
Wow, so this must be fate, huh?

00:24:48.675 --> 00:24:50.176
I was surprised, too.

00:24:50.260 --> 00:24:54.431
I thought you would be
our best choice to create a local song for us,

00:24:54.514 --> 00:24:57.058
so I was gathering footage
in preparation to ask you,

00:24:57.517 --> 00:25:00.395
and I was surprised to see
my old buddy in the backup band!

00:25:00.520 --> 00:25:01.396
Right, Shinno?

00:25:01.521 --> 00:25:02.731
That hurt.

00:25:02.856 --> 00:25:05.984
For Shinnosuke, this will be
a triumphant homecoming performance.

00:25:06.860 --> 00:25:09.779
I'll have to give him a guitar solo
s0 he can shine.

00:25:09.863 --> 00:25:12.657
Nice! Let me do a solo, too!

00:25:12.657 --> 00:25:13.408
You guys, that's still mostly raw.
Nice! Let me do a solo, too!

00:25:13.408 --> 00:25:13.533
You guys, that's still mostly raw.

00:25:13.533 --> 00:25:14.617
You guys, that's still mostly raw.
Your sax doesn't have enough soul in it.

00:25:14.617 --> 00:25:14.701
Your sax doesn't have enough soul in it.

00:25:14.701 --> 00:25:16.536
Excuse me, another plate of this firm kind of
meat. Your sax doesn't have enough soul in it.

00:25:16.536 --> 00:25:16.619
Excuse me, another plate
of this firm kind of meat.

00:25:16.619 --> 00:25:18.246
Excuse me, another plate of this
firm kind of meat. What, a soul?

00:25:18.329 --> 00:25:21.249
So you told Aoi that Shinno was coming back?

00:25:22.125 --> 00:25:23.918
Did you say something, Akane?

00:25:24.210 --> 00:25:25.045
No.

00:25:25.128 --> 00:25:26.421
What's this?

00:25:26.713 --> 00:25:29.257
Are you two together?

00:25:30.050 --> 00:25:32.719
Well, I'll leave that to your imagination.

00:25:32.802 --> 00:25:34.262
Hey, Michinko.

00:25:34.888 --> 00:25:37.015
The booze is tasting bad now!

00:25:37.098 --> 00:25:39.684
- More of the expensive stuff, please!
- And more meat!

00:25:42.395 --> 00:25:43.938
So he can't leave here?

00:25:44.230 --> 00:25:46.149
More like a bound spirit than a living spirit?

00:25:46.232 --> 00:25:49.152
He knew that and still flung himself.

00:25:51.071 --> 00:25:53.782
So my wish does come true.

00:25:55.742 --> 00:25:57.827
At that time, I thought of something.

00:25:57.911 --> 00:26:02.999
Hurry and graduate high school,
go to Tokyo, race to the future,

00:26:03.083 --> 00:26:05.752
and then hurry and come back for Akane.

00:26:07.170 --> 00:26:10.465
I was hoping that day
would hurry up and come.

00:26:10.924 --> 00:26:16.304
So even if I am a living spirit,
it's definitely not because of some grudge.

00:26:18.264 --> 00:26:22.477
Anyway, I don't understand,
but I understand one thing.

00:26:22.644 --> 00:26:27.148
If the future me and Akane get together,
everything will fall into place, right?

00:26:27.816 --> 00:26:32.153
Then this living spirit me will go whoosh!
Right back into the real me's body.

00:26:33.988 --> 00:26:35.824
I'm counting on you, eyeball star.

00:26:40.495 --> 00:26:42.497
Was he always like that?

00:26:44.457 --> 00:26:45.500
Probably.

00:26:45.834 --> 00:26:48.336
Back then, he seemed a little more
mature to me, though.

00:26:48.837 --> 00:26:49.838
What are you going to do?

00:26:50.839 --> 00:26:54.676
Are you going to do what he said,
and help the two of them get together?

00:26:55.677 --> 00:26:57.595
That may not be a bad idea.

00:26:57.679 --> 00:26:58.763
Really?

00:26:58.847 --> 00:27:01.349
It's better than having Akane...

00:27:03.852 --> 00:27:06.855
stay here and be bound to me forever.

00:27:08.857 --> 00:27:11.192
Come on, let's go to the next place!
An after-party!

00:27:11.693 --> 00:27:13.528
S-Sure, just a second.

00:27:13.653 --> 00:27:16.781
Hey, Shinnosuke, if you're going to puke,
do it in the can.

00:27:16.865 --> 00:27:18.366
That was some tasty meat.

00:27:18.533 --> 00:27:20.451
- Let's go somewhere with fish.
- Nah, he's no good.

00:27:20.535 --> 00:27:23.371
- You guys eat a lot.
- I guess it can't be helped.

00:27:23.496 --> 00:27:26.207
I haven't been drinking, so I'll drive him back.

00:27:26.708 --> 00:27:27.500
Masamichi, I'd like to go to a place that has girls,
wherever the local beauties hang out.

00:27:27.500 --> 00:27:29.210
- Are you sure?
- Yes. Masamichi, I'd like to go to a place that has girls, wherever the local beauties hang out.

00:27:29.210 --> 00:27:29.502
Masamichi, I'd like to go to a place that has girls,
wherever the local beauties hang out.

00:27:29.502 --> 00:27:31.880
Come on, let's go, Shinnosuke. Masamichi, I'd like to go to
a place that has girls, wherever the local beauties hang out.

00:27:32.380 --> 00:27:33.882
Uh, sure!

00:27:50.064 --> 00:27:51.232
Gandhara?

00:27:54.068 --> 00:27:54.736
You're awake?

00:27:57.071 --> 00:28:01.242
My dream came true, in a way, right?

00:28:01.743 --> 00:28:03.745
Yes, it did.

00:28:04.913 --> 00:28:06.414
You're mocking me.

00:28:07.248 --> 00:28:11.753
I'm just surprised that you turned out
to be a morose drunk, Shinno.

00:28:12.670 --> 00:28:14.923
You're single, so...

00:28:15.673 --> 00:28:17.425
have you been waiting for me?

00:28:19.761 --> 00:28:21.387
Have I been waiting?

00:28:22.388 --> 00:28:23.348
I think...

00:28:23.431 --> 00:28:24.933
No, I don't think so.

00:28:29.604 --> 00:28:31.105
Here we are.

00:28:32.106 --> 00:28:36.945
- Walk properly, and I'll get you some water.
- Have a drink with me, Ms. Aioi.

00:28:37.612 --> 00:28:39.447
Don't say silly things.

00:28:40.448 --> 00:28:41.449
Hey.

00:28:45.119 --> 00:28:46.037
Ow!

00:28:46.829 --> 00:28:48.039
The hell?

00:28:48.623 --> 00:28:51.042
Don't put on airs at your age.

00:28:51.125 --> 00:28:52.543
Are you being serious?

00:28:53.336 --> 00:28:55.546
Why not? You have nothing to lose.

00:28:56.506 --> 00:28:59.717
Is that the kind of thing to say
after a 13 year reunion?

00:29:01.970 --> 00:29:03.471
Don't disappoint me.

00:29:09.477 --> 00:29:12.897
I didn't want to come either.

00:29:14.190 --> 00:29:17.986
I didn't want to come like this, as I am now.

00:29:19.862 --> 00:29:20.989
I'm back!

00:29:21.531 --> 00:29:22.740
Aoi?

00:29:22.907 --> 00:29:25.243
Welcome back. You're home early.

00:29:26.703 --> 00:29:29.789
I can only take so much wining and dining.

00:29:29.872 --> 00:29:30.373
I'm just going to go to bed
without taking a bath.

00:29:30.373 --> 00:29:33.626
LIVING SPIRIT I'm just going to
go to bed without taking a bath.

00:29:35.545 --> 00:29:37.922
Hey, why don't we sleep
in the same room tonight?

00:29:38.798 --> 00:29:41.259
It'll be fun!
We haven't done that in a long time.

00:29:48.057 --> 00:29:48.933
Hey.

00:29:49.892 --> 00:29:52.437
Tell me about Shinnosuke Kanamuro.

00:29:53.563 --> 00:29:54.981
He's just a drunk.

00:29:55.064 --> 00:29:57.775
Not now. How he used to be.

00:29:58.234 --> 00:30:01.112
It's been so long that I've forgotten.

00:30:01.612 --> 00:30:03.948
I have a bad memory.

00:30:06.659 --> 00:30:10.288
But all these years,
you haven't had a boyfriend.

00:30:11.372 --> 00:30:14.292
I have. Here and there.

00:30:16.919 --> 00:30:20.673
No way! You never showed any sign of it!
Why didn't you ever say anything?

00:30:20.757 --> 00:30:24.886
What? You really are attached to me, huh, Aoi?

00:30:25.678 --> 00:30:26.888
Excuse me?

00:30:28.181 --> 00:30:29.223
Whatever!

00:30:43.863 --> 00:30:44.739
Delicious!

00:30:45.281 --> 00:30:48.618
But are you sure it's okay
for me to eat your lunch?

00:30:48.701 --> 00:30:50.745
I'll go to the convenience store later.

00:30:50.870 --> 00:30:51.746
Yeah?

00:30:52.205 --> 00:30:53.081
Then...

00:30:57.210 --> 00:31:00.088
So you get hungry, too, huh?

00:31:00.505 --> 00:31:03.591
I wouldn't say hungry, but... I can eat.

00:31:03.841 --> 00:31:06.094
The toughest thing is the boredom.

00:31:06.928 --> 00:31:09.097
You've got a guitar. If you're bored...

00:31:10.014 --> 00:31:11.015
The strings are rusty.

00:31:11.432 --> 00:31:13.351
Want me to buy you new ones?
Nickel, right?

00:31:13.434 --> 00:31:14.602
Nah.

00:31:18.106 --> 00:31:19.357
That's okay.

00:31:19.440 --> 00:31:21.526
Instead, would you get me a copy of Jump?

00:31:21.609 --> 00:31:24.278
It doesn't feel right, not reading KochiKame.

00:31:24.570 --> 00:31:26.280
That series is over.

00:31:27.240 --> 00:31:28.783
There's no way KochiKame can be over!

00:31:29.117 --> 00:31:31.369
If Ryo goes, then what does "eternal” mean?

00:31:31.452 --> 00:31:32.954
Don't ask me.

00:31:33.121 --> 00:31:33.955
For real?

00:31:34.247 --> 00:31:35.581
Who did Ryo end up with?

00:31:36.707 --> 00:31:38.418
This guy has no sense of tension.

00:31:38.418 --> 00:31:39.794
Yeah, see you later.
This guy has no sense of tension.

00:31:46.968 --> 00:31:49.303
Huh? This isn't Tsugu, but Michinko?

00:31:49.804 --> 00:31:52.056
This is what he used to look like?

00:31:52.140 --> 00:31:54.475
No wonder Shinno called Tsugu a 'miniature.”

00:31:56.978 --> 00:31:58.312
Akane...

00:31:59.981 --> 00:32:02.984
They were both in the same class.

00:32:10.116 --> 00:32:10.992
Oh, wow.

00:32:10.992 --> 00:32:11.325
CONQUER THE WORLD
Oh, wow.

00:32:11.325 --> 00:32:11.451
CONQUER THE WORLD

00:32:11.451 --> 00:32:13.327
CONQUER THE WORLD
Is Shinno an elementary school student?

00:32:13.828 --> 00:32:15.163
Akane is...

00:32:17.665 --> 00:32:20.334
She wrote something that I would write.

00:32:20.543 --> 00:32:26.591
Akane Aioi The frog at the bottom of a well doesn't know the
vastness of the sea, but it does know the blueness of the sky

00:32:28.634 --> 00:32:33.514
'But it does know the blueness of the sky."

00:32:34.474 --> 00:32:35.516
Aioi!

00:32:36.350 --> 00:32:39.353
Hey, would you reconsider?

00:32:39.854 --> 00:32:40.771
If you joined our band...

00:32:40.855 --> 00:32:44.192
Joining a band that sucks more than me
would just be a waste of time.

00:32:44.817 --> 00:32:46.360
What was that, you ugly rag?

00:32:46.694 --> 00:32:49.197
That girl's got a nasty tongue.

00:32:49.363 --> 00:32:51.032
What a waste.

00:32:52.200 --> 00:32:56.204
The lone woman in a boy band
just sounds way too good.

00:32:57.038 --> 00:33:00.291
But I guess you can afford
to pass up that opportunity.

00:33:00.374 --> 00:33:04.879
After all, you're going to Tokyo
because there are older guys there, right?

00:33:05.338 --> 00:33:06.339
Ugh.

00:33:06.881 --> 00:33:11.302
It's rumored that you always get picked up
and dropped off by a guy in a car.

00:33:11.385 --> 00:33:14.388
Come on, introduce me
to your boyfriend's friends!

00:33:14.514 --> 00:33:17.558
Even if it doesn't work out,
I wouldn't blame you.

00:33:20.394 --> 00:33:22.730
All right, do you want to come with me now?

00:33:26.234 --> 00:33:28.653
Next, about the budget for the stage--

00:33:28.736 --> 00:33:32.990
Before that, what's this "budget for Mr. Nitobe
to learn to love the locale"?

00:33:33.074 --> 00:33:34.575
Oh, that's, well...

00:33:38.162 --> 00:33:38.871
That's...

00:33:39.956 --> 00:33:41.874
for something like this.

00:33:41.999 --> 00:33:44.752
Yes, shaved ice is a local specialty.

00:33:44.752 --> 00:33:45.253
RECEIPT
Yes, shaved ice is a local specialty.

00:33:45.253 --> 00:33:45.962
RECEIPT

00:33:45.962 --> 00:33:46.337
RECEIPT
Wait, 18,000 yen for shaved ice?

00:33:46.337 --> 00:33:46.420
Wait, 18,000 yen for shaved ice?

00:33:46.420 --> 00:33:48.589
SORRY, IS IT OKAY TO SEND YOU THE RECEIPT?
Wait, 18,000 yen for shaved ice?

00:33:48.839 --> 00:33:54.679
He said that unless he tries all of the flavors,
he can't understand the shop owner's spirit.

00:33:54.762 --> 00:33:57.098
I hope he gets diarrhea.

00:33:57.598 --> 00:33:58.516
Nagatoro.

00:33:58.599 --> 00:34:00.434
