00:48:29.136 --> 00:48:30.512
Don't worry about it.

00:48:30.846 --> 00:48:33.265
It's not like I'm going to go to college.

00:48:33.348 --> 00:48:35.058
I see. So what are you going to do?

00:48:38.186 --> 00:48:40.230
Go to Tokyo and be in a band.

00:48:41.523 --> 00:48:44.568
Someone who'll follow in my footsteps
and they're right here!

00:48:44.860 --> 00:48:47.571
Don't praise me so straightforwardly like that.

00:48:48.363 --> 00:48:51.074
I'm not doing it for a logical reason.

00:48:51.450 --> 00:48:52.242
You're not?

00:48:53.535 --> 00:48:56.246
I want to leave this town...

00:48:58.206 --> 00:49:01.585
so Akane can live however way she wants to.

00:49:02.544 --> 00:49:05.922
Because of me,
I'm sure she's had to hold back

00:49:06.715 --> 00:49:09.926
from doing all kinds of things
she's been wanting to do.

00:49:11.553 --> 00:49:17.100
If I stay here,
Akane will be chained to this place forever.

00:49:18.560 --> 00:49:22.606
Besides, there isn't anything
I want to do especially,

00:49:23.064 --> 00:49:25.442
so I don't want her to waste money on me.

00:49:26.193 --> 00:49:29.946
I don't want to be a burden on her any more.

00:49:30.864 --> 00:49:33.116
You're blaming yourself too much.

00:49:33.283 --> 00:49:37.287
- Nobody thinks it's your faul--
- Everyone is thinking that.

00:49:37.370 --> 00:49:39.789
The neighborhood housewives
and our relatives, too.

00:49:41.249 --> 00:49:42.209
<i>Mo...</i>

00:49:43.418 --> 00:49:44.711
It's the truth.

00:49:45.504 --> 00:49:48.215
That's why I'm leaving.

00:49:49.174 --> 00:49:51.051
You're incredible.

00:49:53.345 --> 00:49:54.888
You know...

00:49:56.348 --> 00:50:00.393
I've been thinking about why I'm here.

00:50:01.019 --> 00:50:02.896
A living spirit?

00:50:04.523 --> 00:50:07.901
I don't think it's because of
any lingering attachments.

00:50:08.318 --> 00:50:16.076
But the truth is that some part of me
might be afraid to leave this town.

00:50:17.035 --> 00:50:19.913
In that respect, you're incredible.

00:50:20.372 --> 00:50:21.915
You're full of doubts,

00:50:22.832 --> 00:50:26.920
but you thought it through
and made up your mind to leave this place.

00:50:32.717 --> 00:50:34.719
I got you back for doing that to me.

00:50:34.803 --> 00:50:36.471
You got me back?

00:50:36.555 --> 00:50:39.391
The bassist has to support everyone!

00:50:43.395 --> 00:50:44.479
That's right!

00:50:44.563 --> 00:50:46.982
Now that's my band's future bassist!

00:50:47.065 --> 00:50:49.651
Wait, what? This is the future?

00:50:49.734 --> 00:50:50.360
Then...

00:50:50.443 --> 00:50:51.778
You remembered?

00:50:52.904 --> 00:50:56.616
Remembered? I promised you.

00:50:56.950 --> 00:50:59.578
Isn't that why you're playing the bass?

00:51:06.668 --> 00:51:08.628
Do it to me, too.

00:51:08.878 --> 00:51:11.298
What? Ruffle your hair?

00:51:11.673 --> 00:51:14.301
My forehead. Flick it. Please.

00:51:15.927 --> 00:51:17.429
Well, if you want.

00:51:17.512 --> 00:51:18.888
As hard as you can!

00:51:18.972 --> 00:51:20.307
Okay!

00:51:21.224 --> 00:51:23.810
Ouch!

00:51:28.148 --> 00:51:30.317
Okay, see you tomorrow!

00:51:31.318 --> 00:51:32.319
Hey!

00:51:32.485 --> 00:51:33.653
Ao?!

00:51:48.001 --> 00:51:50.503
What the heck am I doing?

00:51:54.674 --> 00:51:58.678
<i>I have to get
Akane and Shinnosuke together.</i>

00:51:59.262 --> 00:52:00.847
For Akane's sake...

00:52:02.182 --> 00:52:03.850
and Shinno"s sake, too.

00:52:07.854 --> 00:52:09.856
- Morning!
- Good morning.

00:52:12.567 --> 00:52:15.528
FRIDAY THE FIRST

00:52:34.214 --> 00:52:35.298
Listen to this!

00:52:35.382 --> 00:52:38.134
I heard Chika was with a man yesterday!

00:52:38.218 --> 00:52:39.302
What, really?

00:52:39.386 --> 00:52:42.722
Yeah! An older guy, and he looked pretty cool.

00:52:42.806 --> 00:52:43.973
You mean an old geezer?

00:52:44.057 --> 00:52:45.975
But I heard he was pretty hot.

00:52:46.059 --> 00:52:47.185
Maybe he's rich?

00:52:51.064 --> 00:52:52.399
Morning, Aioi...

00:52:52.691 --> 00:52:55.068
Huh? What?

00:52:56.611 --> 00:52:59.572
That hurts! Let go of me!

00:53:01.074 --> 00:53:03.993
The guy you were with yesterday was...

00:53:04.077 --> 00:53:05.995
It was Shinnosuke.

00:53:07.872 --> 00:53:08.832
You're the worst.

00:53:08.957 --> 00:53:14.337
Wait, so as I suspected,
you have a crush on Shinnosuke?

00:53:14.796 --> 00:53:16.214
Of course I don't!

00:53:16.297 --> 00:53:17.507
But Shinno...

00:53:22.971 --> 00:53:23.888
Jeez.

00:53:23.972 --> 00:53:27.934
Look, I wouldn't make a move
on my friend's man.

00:53:28.017 --> 00:53:31.020
Shinno is different from Shinnosuke, right?

00:53:31.479 --> 00:53:32.397
That's right.

00:53:32.480 --> 00:53:36.359
And you like that "Shinno."

00:53:39.612 --> 00:53:41.531
Yeah, I do like him!

00:53:42.824 --> 00:53:44.033
Th-This isn't like you.

00:53:44.451 --> 00:53:46.035
I do like him! Is that bad?

00:53:46.119 --> 00:53:48.204
No, nobody said it was bad.

00:53:50.665 --> 00:53:52.208
What are you doing? Hey...

00:53:52.292 --> 00:53:53.710
It is bad...

00:53:54.627 --> 00:53:56.880
It's totally wrong.

00:53:57.672 --> 00:53:59.215
A-Aioi?

00:54:18.193 --> 00:54:19.402
Oh no.

00:54:20.528 --> 00:54:23.072
Did I forget to lock the door this morning?

00:54:26.034 --> 00:54:28.912
Um... A-Aoi?

00:54:30.663 --> 00:54:32.248
You scared me.

00:54:32.832 --> 00:54:35.752
Sheesh, if you're going to get home
hefore me, text or call.

00:54:35.877 --> 00:54:38.922
I kept trying to reach you,
but it wouldn't go through.

00:54:40.048 --> 00:54:41.257
Why?

00:54:43.343 --> 00:54:44.594
Shinno.

00:54:45.887 --> 00:54:48.431
Why didn't you go with Shinnosuke?

00:54:51.100 --> 00:54:52.310
What's this, all of a sudden?

00:54:52.393 --> 00:54:53.978
If you'd gone with him,

00:54:54.562 --> 00:54:58.691
I'm sure he wouldn't have
turned out to be that jerk!

00:54:59.400 --> 00:55:03.446
He may have stayed the same old Shinno!

00:55:04.405 --> 00:55:06.491
Uh, what are you talking about?

00:55:06.574 --> 00:55:10.328
I don't want to become like you, Akane!

00:55:11.996 --> 00:55:15.333
Denying myself what I want to do
and then regretting it...

00:55:15.416 --> 00:55:16.543
No!

00:55:17.335 --> 00:55:20.004
And then having everything end here...

00:55:20.421 --> 00:55:22.632
I refuse to do it!

00:55:22.715 --> 00:55:26.052
This isn't what I want to be saying!

00:55:26.845 --> 00:55:28.221
Akane, you're...

00:55:29.681 --> 00:55:30.765
Akane, you're...

00:55:30.849 --> 00:55:33.184
I really am...

00:55:33.309 --> 00:55:34.561
really an idiot!

00:55:39.440 --> 00:55:41.568
An idiot, huh?

00:55:47.031 --> 00:55:48.241
Hey, Aoi?

00:56:40.335 --> 00:56:41.794
Oh, it's open.

00:56:43.838 --> 00:56:46.966
Aoi! Are you in here?

00:57:05.985 --> 00:57:09.822
She doesn't want to become like me, huh?

00:57:39.477 --> 00:57:41.354
Kelp again.

00:57:45.483 --> 00:57:53.366
I think I'm just
a good-for-nothing type of person.

00:57:53.491 --> 00:57:57.662
Yeah. You sent a text demanding that an
elementary school student pick up your bass,

00:57:57.745 --> 00:58:01.207
and then barges into his room
and lounges around as if it's your place

00:58:01.290 --> 00:58:03.042
is a good-for-nothing in my book.

00:58:04.043 --> 00:58:07.130
But that Shinnosuke is a thousand times
worse than me!

00:58:07.213 --> 00:58:08.631
Ao, your panties.

00:58:08.715 --> 00:58:09.882
I made up my mind!

00:58:13.886 --> 00:58:16.305
Ao, calm down.

00:58:16.389 --> 00:58:17.223
Michinko!

00:58:19.142 --> 00:58:22.228
I'm going to help you
get together with my sister.

00:58:27.567 --> 00:58:29.569
Dad, it's late.

00:58:30.945 --> 00:58:36.909
A-Aoi, you said you were dead set
against anyone who's been divorced!

00:58:36.993 --> 00:58:38.369
I'll retract that statement.

00:58:38.911 --> 00:58:42.081
I'd rather she be with you
than be taken away by that Shinnosuke.

00:58:44.834 --> 00:58:48.921
I appreciate the sentiment,
but I don't need your help.

00:58:50.506 --> 00:58:55.928
The deciding factor in asking Mr. Nitobe
to do this was because of Shinno.

00:59:01.100 --> 00:59:04.979
I figured you can't move forward
without clearing the deck first.

00:59:05.438 --> 00:59:08.775
That's the age we're at, me and Akane both.

00:59:13.780 --> 00:59:14.530
That's cold!

00:59:14.739 --> 00:59:16.407
Hey, what was that for, Aoi?

00:59:16.491 --> 00:59:17.575
It's foul.

00:59:18.076 --> 00:59:20.828
Adults and your wooly belly, too!

00:59:20.912 --> 00:59:22.121
It's all foul!

00:59:23.581 --> 00:59:24.582
<i>Mo...</i>

00:59:24.665 --> 00:59:28.544
Hey, Tsugu, get me a towel,
would you, please?

00:59:29.087 --> 00:59:30.296
Tsugu!

00:59:48.773 --> 00:59:49.941
FIRST CITY OF MUSIC
FESTIVAL

00:59:49.941 --> 00:59:50.900
FIRST CITY OF MUSIC
FESTIVAL Ms. Akane!

00:59:53.111 --> 00:59:54.862
Where should I put this?

00:59:54.946 --> 00:59:56.989
Oh, I'll take it.

00:59:57.782 --> 01:00:00.284
Sorry. You shouldn't have to spend
your Saturday doing this.

01:00:00.368 --> 01:00:04.288
Not at all! I'm not in a club,
so I have plenty of free time.

01:00:04.372 --> 01:00:07.500
I'll help you all I can
until the show starts in two days.

01:00:08.376 --> 01:00:10.837
Aioi!

01:00:10.962 --> 01:00:12.505
Hey!

01:00:16.217 --> 01:00:17.844
Ignoring me again.

01:00:24.809 --> 01:00:26.185
Hello.

01:00:27.562 --> 01:00:30.731
The lighting director was looking for you
so he could confirm your positions.

01:00:30.815 --> 01:00:32.191
Oh, roger.

01:00:32.316 --> 01:00:36.571
I guess he was also looking for Shin...
I mean Mr. Kanamuro.

01:00:36.654 --> 01:00:40.575
Oh, that's okay. I'll show him
where Shinnosuke's going to stand.

01:00:40.658 --> 01:00:42.368
What? But...

01:00:42.577 --> 01:00:44.704
This is his hometown, right?

01:00:45.329 --> 01:00:47.039
I suppose it's complicated for him.

01:00:47.748 --> 01:00:48.708
Complicated?

01:00:49.250 --> 01:00:54.046
I've always worked behind the scenes,
but he actually made a solo debut a while back.

01:00:54.255 --> 01:00:56.883
But it was with just one song
and then that was it.

01:01:01.012 --> 01:01:02.388
Huh.

01:01:07.852 --> 01:01:08.603
Yama.

01:01:08.686 --> 01:01:09.896
Motoyama.

01:01:12.356 --> 01:01:13.566
What's up?

01:01:13.691 --> 01:01:16.068
Aren't you going to help prepare
for the festival today?

01:01:16.527 --> 01:01:18.029
Yeah, I will.

01:01:18.779 --> 01:01:20.573
I thought I'd tell you first.

01:01:22.533 --> 01:01:24.619
I like Ao.

01:01:25.369 --> 01:01:26.913
A first love thing.

01:01:32.043 --> 01:01:33.961
What are you blushing for?

01:01:34.045 --> 01:01:37.256
I-I'm not blushing...

01:01:38.883 --> 01:01:42.428
You're a precocious runt, aren't you?

01:01:43.054 --> 01:01:44.931
Well, for now I am.

01:01:45.389 --> 01:01:48.643
But by the time I get a full-time job,

01:01:48.726 --> 01:01:52.480
the less than ten year age gap
between us won't mean much.

01:01:53.231 --> 01:01:56.275
Y-Yeah. True.

01:01:56.484 --> 01:02:01.864
Since Ao's not great with academics,
I'll have to pick up the slack there.

01:02:01.948 --> 01:02:05.618
I intend to become a man of value.

01:02:06.535 --> 01:02:08.621
I see.

01:02:09.455 --> 01:02:11.457
You're amazing.

01:02:12.875 --> 01:02:15.628
The only thing is, now I've got a rival.

01:02:16.254 --> 01:02:17.171
Really?

01:02:17.255 --> 01:02:18.130
Yeah.

01:02:22.927 --> 01:02:26.013
So how do you feel about Ao?

01:02:26.097 --> 01:02:27.932
H-Hey! Wait a second!

01:02:28.015 --> 01:02:29.267
Tsugu, think calmly now.

01:02:29.350 --> 01:02:31.978
That's what I should say to you.

01:02:35.314 --> 01:02:37.316
Well, I, uh...

01:02:37.817 --> 01:02:42.154
Look, in my experience,
Akane just shot me down.

01:02:42.780 --> 01:02:45.491
Until then, Aoi was just a little kid.

01:02:45.992 --> 01:02:46.993
Anyway!

01:02:48.327 --> 01:02:51.831
I'm the living spirit of "Shinnosuke,"
so in this form...

01:02:54.333 --> 01:02:57.837
Even if she did fall in love with me,
it wouldn't amount to anything.

01:02:58.296 --> 01:02:59.839
Yeah. I agree.

01:03:01.173 --> 01:03:02.174
That's why...

01:03:04.677 --> 01:03:06.345
Hey, come on.

01:03:06.804 --> 01:03:09.181
How long are you going to ignore me?

01:03:10.349 --> 01:03:12.143
Stay away from me, Jezebel.

01:03:13.519 --> 01:03:17.023
Now that's an extreme label.

01:03:18.524 --> 01:03:22.778
Didn't I already tell you
that nothing happened?

01:03:22.862 --> 01:03:24.697
You can't expect me to believe that!

01:03:25.031 --> 01:03:29.452
A scoundrel plus a Jezebel
equals an illicit sexual rela--

01:03:29.535 --> 01:03:32.705
Look, I was surprised myself, too.

01:03:32.788 --> 01:03:34.707
He was always totally serious.

01:03:34.999 --> 01:03:36.208
What a wuss.

01:03:38.419 --> 01:03:42.923
Where's the prince
who'll take me away from all this?

01:03:43.007 --> 01:03:46.635
Ohtaki, where's the sign-in sheet
I asked you to take care of?

01:03:46.719 --> 01:03:51.223
Sorry! I left it on top of the cart
by the entrance!

01:04:22.755 --> 01:04:27.510
If you go there...

01:04:28.511 --> 01:04:33.933
<i>It's said that...</i>

01:04:35.017 --> 01:04:39.605
all your dreams will...

01:04:48.614 --> 01:04:50.282
Why did you stop?

01:04:53.619 --> 01:04:54.703
Keep playing.

01:05:04.338 --> 01:05:10.719
I had a feeling that when I moved to Tokyo,
all my dreams would come true.

01:05:11.470 --> 01:05:13.722
But they didn't.

01:05:15.182 --> 01:05:17.560
But your dream came true.

01:05:17.852 --> 01:05:19.437
You play guitar for a living.

01:05:19.520 --> 01:05:24.233
It's not like I wanted to be
in the backup band for an enka singer.

01:05:24.400 --> 01:05:25.067
Still...

01:05:25.151 --> 01:05:27.236
I'm not complaining.

01:05:28.028 --> 01:05:30.072
I'm grateful to Mr. Nitobe.

01:05:30.364 --> 01:05:33.409
I'm satisfied to at least
be involved with music.

01:05:34.618 --> 01:05:41.083
But I don't know if it was necessary
to leave, considering all the things I gave up.

01:05:46.338 --> 01:05:49.758
Then, can I request a different song?

01:05:54.555 --> 01:05:56.432
"Her Blue Sky."

01:05:59.727 --> 01:06:00.561
Why do you...

01:06:01.228 --> 01:06:02.438
I bought it.

01:06:02.563 --> 01:06:04.440
Your solo debut song.

01:06:04.899 --> 01:06:06.609
But that's my dark past.

01:06:08.903 --> 01:06:12.114
I like that song about
as much as I like "Gandhara."

01:06:30.925 --> 01:06:34.053
I didn't like it at all

01:06:34.428 --> 01:06:39.934
Horror movies and caramel-flavored kisses

01:06:40.017 --> 01:06:43.270
I couldn't fall in love with it at all

01:06:43.354 --> 01:06:55.866
Even still, all I can do now while I scream
ls search for your face

01:06:57.117 --> 01:06:58.577
Dankichi Nitobe style!

01:06:59.453 --> 01:07:05.084
There's a hole in my heart that's a trap door

01:07:05.209 --> 01:07:11.257
<i>It's so dark in here that I can't see</i>

01:07:11.632 --> 01:07:17.012
- What is that? Sing normally!
- Next, math teacher Saito style!

01:07:17.388 --> 01:07:21.517
There's really no reason behind it

01:07:25.688 --> 01:07:26.730
Akane...

01:07:27.898 --> 01:07:29.108
And...

01:07:32.444 --> 01:07:36.448
the person who can make
Akane laugh like that..

01:07:38.075 --> 01:07:39.159
It can only be...

01:07:43.163 --> 01:07:45.791
Shinno, after all.

01:07:50.337 --> 01:07:52.214
Okay, thank you very much.

01:07:54.800 --> 01:07:56.635
Ugh, my stomach hurts.

01:07:56.927 --> 01:07:59.722
Sheesh, you were supposed to sing normally.

01:07:59.805 --> 01:08:02.641
You know, it's still nice being with you like this.

01:08:03.976 --> 01:08:05.394
It's like I can relax.

01:08:06.812 --> 01:08:09.148
I'm thinking about coming back.

01:08:10.316 --> 01:08:13.819
It's not like there's a future
ahead of me with this current job.

01:08:13.902 --> 01:08:14.903
No!

01:08:15.321 --> 01:08:22.286
How can I put it? It's like everyone else
got a solid job and is settling down.

01:08:22.411 --> 01:08:25.205
Maybe I'm at the age
where I should be doing the same thing.

01:08:25.289 --> 01:08:29.335
No! Then "Shinno” will disappear!

01:08:29.668 --> 01:08:31.170
What are you talking about?

01:08:31.837 --> 01:08:35.674
In this day and age,
30 or so is still a youngster, right?

01:08:36.175 --> 01:08:38.677
It's too early to settle down.

01:08:41.347 --> 01:08:44.516
For me, there's something
that I can only do here.

01:08:44.850 --> 01:08:47.686
I haven't given up yet on a lot of other things.

01:08:48.187 --> 01:08:50.522
Yep. It's from here on and out.

01:08:57.154 --> 01:08:58.197
I see.

01:08:58.697 --> 01:08:59.865
That's right.

01:09:00.532 --> 01:09:02.701
Yeah. You're right.

01:09:09.041 --> 01:09:10.042
Are you going back?

01:09:10.376 --> 01:09:12.711
Yeah. I'd better get going.

01:09:13.337 --> 01:09:14.380
See you later.

01:10:07.599 --> 01:10:11.687
So that's how Akane cries.

01:10:13.105 --> 01:10:14.606
<i>I didn't know.</i>

01:10:15.566 --> 01:10:17.443
The last time she cried..

01:10:19.653 --> 01:10:21.947
How long has it been since I saw her cry?

01:10:37.463 --> 01:10:38.964
Akane, can you get me the--

01:10:58.150 --> 01:10:59.401
Jeez.

01:11:05.866 --> 01:11:07.868
"Strategy"?

01:11:33.644 --> 01:11:34.686
Hey, Aoi!

01:11:34.812 --> 01:11:35.646
- Are you okay?
- Yummy!

01:11:35.813 --> 01:11:41.193
Come on, Aoi, if you have nothing to do,
then help me a little.

01:11:41.318 --> 01:11:42.486
No way!

01:11:42.569 --> 01:11:44.655
You're good at making deep-fried food

01:11:44.738 --> 01:11:49.368
so the ingredients shout with joy
when a talented person uses them for cooking.

01:11:51.411 --> 01:11:52.538
I suppose.

01:11:53.413 --> 01:11:56.542
What was this "burden”
that I was talking about?

01:11:57.167 --> 01:12:01.046
I always had the feeling
that Akane could do anything.

01:12:01.588 --> 01:12:07.052
But she only looked perfect..

01:12:28.115 --> 01:12:29.575
For my sake.

01:12:31.535 --> 01:12:33.203
WHAT A BIG SUCCESS IN SATISFYING AOI!

01:12:37.541 --> 01:12:40.586
<i>It's because she's been trying so hard...</i>

01:12:44.172 --> 01:12:45.215
and I..

01:12:49.261 --> 01:12:53.265
What am I doing?

01:13:29.968 --> 01:13:32.137
Oh. It's just you, Ao.

01:13:32.262 --> 01:13:35.057
What happened to using our password?
Jeez, you scared me.

01:13:35.140 --> 01:13:36.475
I like you, Shinno.

01:13:44.483 --> 01:13:47.486
Listen... I'm flattered.

01:13:47.653 --> 01:13:49.655
But think about it really hard.

01:13:49.780 --> 01:13:51.823
- I'm a living spir--
- Shut up!

01:13:54.993 --> 01:13:58.330
I mean, your voice is so kind.

01:13:58.622 --> 01:14:05.003
Someone with that kind of voice generally says
comforting and compassionate things.

01:14:07.506 --> 01:14:10.801
Even if you didn't mean to comfort me,

01:14:11.510 --> 01:14:19.184
your voice is wonderful and warm and it kind of
makes me sad, so I don't want to hear it.

01:14:20.686 --> 01:14:23.522
For now, let me get all of my feelings out.

01:14:34.866 --> 01:14:36.868
I like you, Shinno.

01:14:38.161 --> 01:14:43.041
Not "Shinnosuke,"
but you, the "Shinno" who's right here.

01:14:44.042 --> 01:14:45.544
I want to be with you forever.

01:14:46.545 --> 01:14:49.381
Rather than have you return to "Shinnosuke,"

01:14:49.506 --> 01:14:51.216
I want you to stay here!

01:14:53.677 --> 01:14:54.469
<i>Mo...</i>

01:14:54.553 --> 01:14:55.721
But...

01:14:56.388 --> 01:14:57.556
But...

01:14:58.724 --> 01:15:02.060
I also love Akane!

01:15:04.229 --> 01:15:05.397
And Akane...

01:15:06.064 --> 01:15:09.234
still loves "Shinnosuke."

01:15:10.027 --> 01:15:12.070
When I think about Akane's happiness...

01:15:13.739 --> 01:15:15.907
But then you would...

01:15:18.243 --> 01:15:20.746
I don't know what I should do anymore.

01:15:21.747 --> 01:15:24.082
Tell me, what should I do?

01:15:26.251 --> 01:15:27.085
Don't touch me!

01:15:29.212 --> 01:15:32.924
If you touch me,
it'll only make me like you even more!

01:15:33.675 --> 01:15:36.344
Th-Then... what should I do?

01:15:36.720 --> 01:15:38.263
You don't know either?

01:15:38.555 --> 01:15:39.848
How could I know?

01:15:39.931 --> 01:15:41.099
Then...

01:15:44.436 --> 01:15:45.312
Never mind!

01:15:46.271 --> 01:15:48.106
Hey, wait! I said wait!

01:15:48.648 --> 01:15:49.941
Please!

01:15:51.443 --> 01:15:52.611
Please...

01:15:54.112 --> 01:15:55.030
Wait...

01:15:55.989 --> 01:15:58.867
I... can't run after you.

01:16:00.660 --> 01:16:04.539
Even if I want to run after you, it's impossible.

01:16:06.666 --> 01:16:08.877
All I can do is see you off from here.

01:16:10.962 --> 01:16:17.886
I don't have any idea either, of what
would happen if I return to my original self.

01:16:18.804 --> 01:16:27.229
But only being able to watch
as you run off crying like a brat is...

01:16:30.023 --> 01:16:31.191
I'm not crying.

01:16:32.692 --> 01:16:34.069
I'm not crying!

01:16:34.528 --> 01:16:36.071
It's the rain!

01:16:44.204 --> 01:16:47.916
Hey, why am I here?

01:16:52.212 --> 01:16:54.256
Why?

01:17:15.902 --> 01:17:18.155
CONCERT HALL

01:17:26.246 --> 01:17:27.372
Morning.

01:17:29.249 --> 01:17:31.668
Morning. Um...

01:17:32.919 --> 01:17:34.713
About yesterday... I'm sorry.

01:17:35.672 --> 01:17:37.924
Oh, there's no need to apologize!

01:17:38.008 --> 01:17:40.760
- I was totally bothering you about it, too.
- But...

01:17:40.844 --> 01:17:41.928
Well, uh--

01:17:42.012 --> 01:17:43.221
It's not here!

01:17:43.555 --> 01:17:45.056
PERFORMERS WAITING
ROOM It's not here!

01:17:45.348 --> 01:17:47.267
Are you missing something, Mr. Nitobe?

01:17:47.350 --> 01:17:51.438
My pendant! The one
I'm always wearing is gone!

01:17:51.521 --> 01:17:55.400
Pendant? Oh! That gaudy looking one.

01:17:58.028 --> 01:18:00.447
That's the source of my energy.

01:18:00.530 --> 01:18:05.327
All the feelings I've received from people
all across this land are sealed inside of it.

01:18:05.911 --> 01:18:08.955
Without it, I won't be able
to sing the local heart.

01:18:09.039 --> 01:18:12.250
I won't be able to sing the heart of enka!

01:18:13.001 --> 01:18:15.921
That phrase sounds really familiar to me.

01:18:17.380 --> 01:18:20.759
Mr. Nitobe, it wasn't in the car either.

01:18:22.135 --> 01:18:23.178
Mr. Nitobe.

01:18:23.261 --> 01:18:27.349
Well, when was the last time you saw it?

01:18:27.807 --> 01:18:29.017
The last time?

01:18:29.100 --> 01:18:32.103
In that case, um...

01:18:32.229 --> 01:18:33.813
Oh, the Wado Ruins.

01:18:33.897 --> 01:18:35.106
Oh, there it is!

01:18:35.190 --> 01:18:38.318
Could that be Mitsumine Shrine?

01:18:38.401 --> 01:18:40.070
You're having too much fun.

01:18:40.153 --> 01:18:44.449
I mean, in every photo, you have
your arms around women"s shoulders.

01:18:45.325 --> 01:18:48.161
That's the rapport I have with locals.

01:18:48.245 --> 01:18:50.705
So these pictures are from yesterday.

01:18:50.789 --> 01:18:51.831
Oh, this one.

01:18:51.915 --> 01:18:53.708
From this photo on,
you're not wearing the pendant.

01:18:53.792 --> 01:18:54.918
Oh yeah.

01:18:55.001 --> 01:18:56.503
Then...

01:18:56.670 --> 01:18:58.922
The last place he had it on it was...

01:18:59.339 --> 01:19:00.173
There!

01:19:00.257 --> 01:19:01.675
Yes, this tunnel!

01:19:01.758 --> 01:19:03.468
Charming, isn't it?

01:19:03.593 --> 01:19:06.846
There was a fence,
but I just went through it like this...

01:19:06.930 --> 01:19:07.847
That's it!

01:19:07.931 --> 01:19:12.602
Yes, it did have this sort of
survival instinct feeling to it.

01:19:12.686 --> 01:19:14.562
Then I'll go look for it there.

01:19:14.646 --> 01:19:16.815
Huh? Are you sure?

01:19:17.274 --> 01:19:19.317
In the meantime,
please prepare for rehearsal, Mr. Nitobe.

01:19:19.859 --> 01:19:22.153
B-Be careful, Akane!

01:19:36.501 --> 01:19:37.669
Akane!

01:19:38.670 --> 01:19:39.504
Aoi?

01:19:41.339 --> 01:19:42.340
Is something wrong?

01:19:44.676 --> 01:19:45.427
No.

01:19:47.178 --> 01:19:48.847
Be careful.

01:19:49.639 --> 01:19:52.851
I will. And you do your best at rehearsal.

01:19:55.020 --> 01:19:57.981
All right. While having faith
that my pendant will return to me,

01:19:58.523 --> 01:20:01.526
let's do what we've set out to do.

01:20:01.860 --> 01:20:04.529
Let's make the most of the feelings
from the good people here.

01:20:04.988 --> 01:20:07.198
There's no more time to relax!

01:20:07.324 --> 01:20:09.701
I can't believe he has the gall to say that.

01:20:09.868 --> 01:20:11.619
And where's Shinnosuke?

01:20:11.703 --> 01:20:16.875
Oh, he said he had somewhere to stop by,
so he'll meet up with us after.

01:20:56.331 --> 01:20:57.916
Oof...

01:20:58.583 --> 01:21:02.420
Sheesh, why did he have to come this far?

01:21:17.102 --> 01:21:18.269
Shaking?

01:21:29.197 --> 01:21:31.449
- I'm sure I felt a tremor before.
- Yes, this is Nakamura.

01:21:31.574 --> 01:21:32.450
Really?

01:21:32.992 --> 01:21:35.453
- Yes... Yes...
- A bulletin hasn't come out yet.

01:21:37.205 --> 01:21:39.707
Yes, understood. Okay.

01:21:39.791 --> 01:21:41.292
What's wrong?

01:21:41.459 --> 01:21:43.628
There's been a landslide near Hino.

01:21:43.711 --> 01:21:47.924
I have to go back and issue a warning
as someone from the Tourism Bureau.

01:21:48.007 --> 01:21:48.883
A landslide?

01:21:48.967 --> 01:21:49.884
What?!

01:21:49.968 --> 01:21:52.887
Oh, it apparently happened
in the mountains,

01:21:52.971 --> 01:21:56.057
so we don't have any
confirmed damage at the moment.

01:21:56.141 --> 01:21:58.560
- Oh.
- That must've been the earthquake I felt!

01:21:58.643 --> 01:22:01.146
- That's a small mercy.
- It has been raining a lot lately.

01:22:01.229 --> 01:22:03.982
Hino? The tunnel where Akane went is in Hino!

01:22:05.984 --> 01:22:07.819
- I-Is Akane all right?
- Ao!

01:22:08.695 --> 01:22:10.655
Calm down. Use your phone.

01:22:13.867 --> 01:22:15.076
Aioi.

01:22:19.539 --> 01:22:21.749
No good. It's not going through!

01:22:21.833 --> 01:22:24.085
Hey, you're overthinking it.

01:22:24.377 --> 01:22:26.629
Negativity doesn't do any good.

01:22:26.713 --> 01:22:28.923
Be positive and act positively!

01:22:29.174 --> 01:22:30.425
You have no right to say that.

01:22:30.508 --> 01:22:32.927
Anyway, I'm going to City Hall.

01:22:33.011 --> 01:22:36.264
As soon as I find out anything,
I'll let you know, so wait here!

01:22:36.890 --> 01:22:39.642
Sorry, Mr. Nitobe,
but you should wait here, too.

01:22:39.726 --> 01:22:41.978
Certainly. Please be careful.

01:22:42.061 --> 01:22:43.813
Tsugu, take care of everyone else!

01:22:43.897 --> 01:22:44.939
Right.

01:22:47.275 --> 01:22:48.443
<i>Mo...</i>

01:22:53.907 --> 01:22:56.117
Hey. Aioi?

01:22:59.037 --> 01:23:02.290
Yes, so can you send a car... Huh?

01:23:02.665 --> 01:23:04.626
H-Hey! Ao!

01:23:05.418 --> 01:23:06.961
Where are you going?

01:23:08.588 --> 01:23:13.301
<i>Why is my high school self here?</i>

01:23:15.470 --> 01:23:16.513
I see.

01:23:17.222 --> 01:23:18.139
So...

01:23:20.099 --> 01:23:22.644
Have you come to pick up the Akane Special?

01:23:24.187 --> 01:23:25.313
How did you...

01:23:26.147 --> 01:23:27.732
The treasured guitar

01:23:27.815 --> 01:23:31.194
that Akane went with you to buy, after
saving enough money from a part-time job.

01:23:31.903 --> 01:23:34.697
Looks like it's been
abandoned here for years, though.

01:23:37.575 --> 01:23:43.373
Lame. Just because your dream didn't
come true, that's no reason to sulk.

01:23:44.415 --> 01:23:45.917
What does a kid know?

01:23:46.000 --> 01:23:50.046
I don't even want to know
about some grimy old man.

01:23:50.338 --> 01:23:51.673
You...

01:23:55.343 --> 01:23:56.386
Shin...

01:23:59.180 --> 01:24:01.558
Shin... nosuke?

01:24:02.267 --> 01:24:03.268
Why?

01:24:03.351 --> 01:24:05.061
Is something wrong, Ao?

01:24:05.728 --> 01:24:07.730
That's right! Shinno, Akane is...

01:24:11.025 --> 01:24:11.943
A landslide?

01:24:12.026 --> 01:24:13.111
And Akane got--

01:24:13.194 --> 01:24:15.113
I don't know yet, but...

01:24:15.196 --> 01:24:18.074
Michinko is looking into it now.

01:24:18.449 --> 01:24:20.910
I'm sure she's okay.

01:24:21.035 --> 01:24:27.584
But I can't reach her
and I've been having bad feelings.

01:24:28.459 --> 01:24:30.753
Come on, don't spook me.

01:24:31.045 --> 01:24:34.757
Well, for now, let's wait for Michinko's news.

01:24:35.508 --> 01:24:37.427
How can you be so calm about it?

01:24:38.886 --> 01:24:41.598
Why are you just standing there?

01:24:42.223 --> 01:24:43.141
Why?

01:24:43.224 --> 01:24:45.768
Hurry up and go search for Akane!

01:24:45.852 --> 01:24:47.979
Why aren't you doing anything?

01:24:48.062 --> 01:24:50.940
- Even if I go right now--
- If you don't...

01:24:51.816 --> 01:24:52.900
H-Hey...

01:24:52.984 --> 01:24:55.236
If you don't go, who will?

01:24:56.904 --> 01:24:58.990
Don't disappoint me.

01:25:00.241 --> 01:25:01.451
Shinno...

01:25:02.118 --> 01:25:07.290
Weren't you supposed to become a big musician
and then come back to take Akane?

01:25:08.666 --> 01:25:11.294
Instead you're a member of a backup band.

01:25:11.419 --> 01:25:12.920
And to an enka singer?

01:25:13.004 --> 01:25:14.339
Unbelievable!

01:25:14.422 --> 01:25:17.258
- Shut up.
- Lame! Lame! Lame!

01:25:17.342 --> 01:25:19.302
I feel like I've been
dunked in a swamp of puke!

01:25:19.552 --> 01:25:22.055
- To think I'll become somebody like you in--
- I said shut up!

01:25:22.263 --> 01:25:24.098
- Stop it!
- Even so...

01:25:24.682 --> 01:25:27.018
I'm out there doing something every day!

01:25:27.101 --> 01:25:29.520
Yeah, you've hecome
uselessly better at the guitar.

01:25:29.771 --> 01:25:32.565
With all your playing,
you could make a living anywhere!

01:25:32.649 --> 01:25:35.943
This world is all about connections and luck!

01:25:36.027 --> 01:25:38.237
Just because you're good,
doesn't mean you'll make it.

01:25:38.321 --> 01:25:39.572
You don't know anything, you brat.

01:25:39.656 --> 01:25:41.991
Yeah, that's right, I don't know anything!

01:25:43.326 --> 01:25:47.205
Because I couldn't leave here...

01:25:48.164 --> 01:25:48.998
What?

01:25:49.540 --> 01:25:50.708
Shinno...

01:25:51.376 --> 01:25:55.338
That day, when Akane told me
she wasn't going to Tokyo...

01:25:55.880 --> 01:25:57.548
I was really shocked.

01:25:58.383 --> 01:26:01.803
Going to Tokyo, forming a band,
performing at venues one after the other,

01:26:02.512 --> 01:26:06.057
making a major debut,
having fun every day...

01:26:06.683 --> 01:26:08.726
That was my dream, but...

01:26:09.686 --> 01:26:16.901
but it was all under the assumption
that Akane would be with me.

01:26:18.569 --> 01:26:22.031
I said I'd become a big musician
and then come back for her,

01:26:22.115 --> 01:26:24.242
but really, nobody knows what could happen.

01:26:25.201 --> 01:26:29.497
At that point, somewhere in my head,
I thought that I didn't want to go anywhere.

01:26:30.415 --> 01:26:32.250
I wanted to just stay here forever.

01:26:33.292 --> 01:26:34.419
That's what I thought.

01:26:35.878 --> 01:26:37.004
But...

01:26:38.047 --> 01:26:39.590
you left!

01:26:41.426 --> 01:26:43.678
You moved forward!

01:26:44.429 --> 01:26:46.681
Come on, make me believe it.

01:26:47.348 --> 01:26:48.933
I'm you, right?

01:26:49.600 --> 01:26:51.602
Then make me believe it!

01:26:52.270 --> 01:26:56.441
I'm sure there are all kinds of things
that won't work out, but still, in the future...

01:26:58.943 --> 01:27:01.612
That it may be okay for me to become you.

01:27:04.282 --> 01:27:05.950
Make me believe that!

01:27:09.370 --> 01:27:10.455
I...

01:27:12.874 --> 01:27:14.292
Forget it!

01:27:14.500 --> 01:27:15.626
Shin!

01:27:25.303 --> 01:27:27.638
What are you doing?

01:27:28.973 --> 01:27:30.641
I'm going!

01:27:32.518 --> 01:27:35.688
I said I'm going!

01:27:38.941 --> 01:27:45.114
You can stay here and whine forever
like the old man you are!

01:27:45.198 --> 01:27:46.449
Why?

01:27:46.532 --> 01:27:55.249
I've been frozen in time, but my feelings
for Akane have never changed!

01:27:56.375 --> 01:28:03.132
No one can lose to me on that, not even you!

01:28:06.177 --> 01:28:07.595
A-Ao?

01:28:07.804 --> 01:28:09.305
Me too!

01:28:09.388 --> 01:28:14.352
When it comes to feelings for Akane,
I won't lose either!

01:28:21.317 --> 01:28:24.779
Didn't you tell me not to touch you, Ao?

01:28:25.738 --> 01:28:30.117
Shut up!

01:28:54.976 --> 01:28:56.310
Ow...

01:29:00.523 --> 01:29:01.566
There.

01:29:01.858 --> 01:29:02.942
Are you okay?

01:29:03.025 --> 01:29:04.068
Yeah.

01:29:04.527 --> 01:29:05.903
What the hell is this?

01:29:06.028 --> 01:29:09.031
Well, we're going to go.

01:29:09.532 --> 01:29:11.409
What are you going to do, old man?

01:29:12.201 --> 01:29:14.537
Wh-What am I going to do?

01:29:15.037 --> 01:29:15.997
I...

01:29:16.080 --> 01:29:17.248
Let's go, Ao!

01:29:17.498 --> 01:29:18.958
Huh? Wh...

01:29:19.041 --> 01:29:20.251
Hey! You...

01:29:24.547 --> 01:29:27.258
You think you can say whatever you want?

01:29:29.844 --> 01:29:32.430
Wait! Shinno!

01:29:33.055 --> 01:29:34.432
You're too fast!

01:29:36.058 --> 01:29:37.268
Hey!

01:29:37.560 --> 01:29:39.770
Come on, come on!

01:29:45.401 --> 01:29:48.946
Here I come, Akane!

01:29:54.660 --> 01:29:56.996
He's flying? What the hell!

01:29:57.079 --> 01:29:58.956
Where did that come from?

01:30:04.378 --> 01:30:06.756
This is awesome! How am I doing this?

01:30:06.839 --> 01:30:10.134
That's what I want to know!

01:30:11.427 --> 01:30:15.139
Aren't there any taxis around here?
Damn countryside!

01:30:36.410 --> 01:30:41.374
So, when I saw that photo,
I figured out a lot of things.

01:30:41.582 --> 01:30:42.833
Like what?

01:30:43.334 --> 01:30:50.841
At that time, he had to seal things inside
so that he could move forward.

01:30:50.925 --> 01:30:53.844
But now, he's decided to confront it once more

01:31:07.108 --> 01:31:13.447
not to let the same feelings
that are inside me to be a regret.

01:31:14.699 --> 01:31:20.955
Look, we can't let any cars go further
until it's confirmed that the area is safe.

01:31:21.038 --> 01:31:23.541
- You can go back to the nearest station--
- It's fine!

01:31:24.041 --> 01:31:25.543
Here, keep the change.

01:31:26.085 --> 01:31:27.044
Hey!

01:31:27.420 --> 01:31:28.879
Only cars can't get through, right?

01:31:29.463 --> 01:31:31.882
- Then--
- Hey, are you Shinno?

01:31:32.299 --> 01:31:34.719
It's me! Abo.

01:31:35.594 --> 01:31:38.305
- Long time no see! When'd you--
- Sorry!

01:31:38.556 --> 01:31:40.474
I'm in a hurry! I don't have time to talk!

01:31:40.558 --> 01:31:44.729
Hey, wait!
Where are you off to in such a hurry?

01:31:44.812 --> 01:31:46.397
Gandhara!

01:31:50.276 --> 01:31:54.238
So that's why I was there.

01:31:55.156 --> 01:31:56.240
Regrets...

01:31:57.616 --> 01:31:59.577
I know of one.

01:32:03.414 --> 01:32:07.334
When you can't support
the feelings of the person you love,

01:32:09.378 --> 01:32:11.255
you'll feel regret for the longest time.

01:32:13.466 --> 01:32:18.929
I know that because I couldn't support Akane.

01:32:19.889 --> 01:32:20.598
Ao?

01:32:21.265 --> 01:32:27.772
So that's why I'm going
to help you and Shinnosuke.

01:32:34.570 --> 01:32:35.446
Wha...

01:32:51.462 --> 01:32:52.797
What was that for?

01:32:53.005 --> 01:32:54.173
Well...

01:32:54.256 --> 01:32:58.969
For newborn babies, they say if you blow
a puff of air there, the baby will stop crying.

01:33:06.811 --> 01:33:08.145
How weird.

01:33:08.813 --> 01:33:09.814
Shut up.

01:33:14.819 --> 01:33:17.488
The sky is so blue.

01:33:21.492 --> 01:33:27.123
I thought I couldn't wait to get out of here,
but it's so beautiful.

01:33:30.334 --> 01:33:31.335
Yeah.

01:33:34.713 --> 01:33:36.006
It is.

01:33:47.518 --> 01:33:49.019
Found it.

01:33:49.520 --> 01:33:52.731
Good grief. All that trouble over this.

01:33:52.815 --> 01:33:55.359
In the middle of this emergency...

01:33:56.193 --> 01:33:58.362
I swear, you have nerves of steel.

01:34:03.367 --> 01:34:04.702
Shinno?

01:34:14.211 --> 01:34:15.212
There you are!

01:34:16.922 --> 01:34:18.883
Where's the other me?

01:34:19.884 --> 01:34:20.885
Where's Akane?

01:34:26.056 --> 01:34:27.224
I see.

01:34:27.725 --> 01:34:29.393
It's preposterous, huh?

01:34:30.227 --> 01:34:31.645
It's very you, Shinno.

01:34:31.729 --> 01:34:33.147
You believe me?

01:34:33.230 --> 01:34:36.233
After all, you're here, in front of me.

01:34:37.401 --> 01:34:39.904
It's scary how nothing fazes you.

01:34:40.988 --> 01:34:42.072
But I'm glad.

01:34:43.282 --> 01:34:44.575
It's dark in here.

01:34:45.242 --> 01:34:48.078
If it were bright,
you can see how old I've gotten.

01:34:48.954 --> 01:34:51.415
You'd be disappointed, Shinno.

01:34:51.498 --> 01:34:54.960
Sorry. I've already seen how you look now.

01:34:55.044 --> 01:34:56.879
What? When? Where?

01:34:56.962 --> 01:34:58.255
In the hall.

01:34:59.131 --> 01:35:02.927
When you went to check on Ao
and when you brought rice balls.

01:35:04.136 --> 01:35:05.596
Really?

01:35:05.763 --> 01:35:07.765
They were kelp again.

01:35:08.933 --> 01:35:12.061
The rice balls. I kept telling you
I wanted mayonnaise and tuna,

01:35:12.144 --> 01:35:14.271
but you always made them
with Ao's favorite kelp.

01:35:15.356 --> 01:35:16.607
Sorry about that.

01:35:16.774 --> 01:35:17.942
But you know...

01:35:19.109 --> 01:35:20.444
I understand now.

01:35:24.156 --> 01:35:27.201
"The frog at the bottom of a well
doesn't know the vastness of the sea,"

01:35:28.077 --> 01:35:30.871
"but it does know the blueness of the sky."

01:35:32.748 --> 01:35:34.375
You liked that expression.

01:35:35.251 --> 01:35:36.377
Shinno?

01:35:37.253 --> 01:35:39.880
Mayo and tuna can't beat kelp, huh?

01:35:40.422 --> 01:35:42.549
Once you know how blue the sky is...

01:35:49.515 --> 01:35:51.058
She's gotten cute, hasn't she?

01:35:56.021 --> 01:35:57.398
I don't know about that.

01:35:57.773 --> 01:36:04.571
She's gotten bigger, sure,
but she's surly, tactless, and not very smart.

01:36:06.031 --> 01:36:08.951
But she's as straightforward as an arrow.

01:36:09.034 --> 01:36:13.414
Yeah. Straightforward and dumb.

01:36:14.540 --> 01:36:17.084
That's where she reminds me a lot of you.

01:36:19.044 --> 01:36:20.254
I'm glad.

01:36:21.213 --> 01:36:22.089
Hup!

01:36:22.965 --> 01:36:27.094
Your little sister, Ao,
is the most precious thing in the world to you.

01:36:31.140 --> 01:36:34.601
I'm glad I fell in love with you.

01:36:39.315 --> 01:36:40.858
You can't!

01:36:40.941 --> 01:36:46.155
It could collapse again at any moment,
so unless you can fly...

01:36:46.238 --> 01:36:48.615
Let go of me! Akane is still...

01:36:50.909 --> 01:36:52.369
What are you two doing?

01:36:56.248 --> 01:36:57.166
Akane! Thank g--

01:36:57.249 --> 01:36:58.042
Aoi!

01:36:58.667 --> 01:37:00.961
Whoa! Akane, you're heavy.

01:37:01.045 --> 01:37:02.212
What, that's mean.

01:37:02.296 --> 01:37:04.006
Wait, you're okay?

01:37:04.214 --> 01:37:07.051
It was nothing! You're such a worrywart.

01:37:07.134 --> 01:37:08.761
What are you talking about?

01:37:08.844 --> 01:37:10.846
We were all worried about you!

01:37:10.929 --> 01:37:14.975
I'm sorry, Aoi. Sorry to make you worry!

01:37:16.727 --> 01:37:20.481
Jeez! You should be sorry!

01:37:42.628 --> 01:37:45.047
Huh? You're going home by yourself?

01:37:45.130 --> 01:37:46.215
- Yeah.
- What?

01:37:46.673 --> 01:37:49.051
Why? We can all fit in here.

01:37:49.134 --> 01:37:52.679
No, four people is a tight squeeze
in your car, Akane.

01:37:53.055 --> 01:37:54.932
I'll catch a taxi on the way back.

01:37:55.224 --> 01:37:57.518
- In that case, I'll...
- Nah.

01:37:57.893 --> 01:37:59.436
You three go.

01:38:00.229 --> 01:38:01.271
Aoi?

01:38:03.565 --> 01:38:05.776
See you, Shinno.

01:38:07.361 --> 01:38:08.445
Yeah.

01:38:08.821 --> 01:38:09.947
Thanks...

01:38:10.239 --> 01:38:11.448
eyeball star.

01:38:27.172 --> 01:38:27.965
Huh?

01:38:29.299 --> 01:38:30.300
Is he...

01:38:31.135 --> 01:38:32.302
sleeping?

01:38:33.971 --> 01:38:36.974
It's fine, isn't it? He worked hard.

01:38:42.521 --> 01:38:43.647
Hey, I...

01:38:45.649 --> 01:38:48.986
He said I moved forward.

01:38:51.155 --> 01:38:53.991
But I'm still only midway through all of it.

01:38:55.826 --> 01:38:58.495
I remembered that I'm only midway through.

01:39:00.164 --> 01:39:04.501
So I don't want to give up either.

01:39:06.211 --> 01:39:07.171
Yeah.

01:39:09.006 --> 01:39:12.426
And I'm not giving up on you either.

01:39:23.187 --> 01:39:24.980
The three of us, huh?

01:39:27.608 --> 01:39:33.530
I see. Aoi is about
the same age I was back then.

01:39:44.500 --> 01:39:49.046
Next time maybe I'll try making rice balls
with mayo and tuna inside.

01:39:52.257 --> 01:39:53.884
Hey, what does that...

01:39:55.219 --> 01:39:56.053
Huh?

01:40:24.331 --> 01:40:27.042
I'm not crying!

01:40:53.026 --> 01:40:54.278
I'm not...

01:40:57.114 --> 01:40:58.282
crying...

01:41:04.663 --> 01:41:06.123
Stupid Shinno.

01:41:32.232 --> 01:41:33.483
The sky...

01:41:35.319 --> 01:41:36.820
is stupidly blue.
